Cell["\<\
gaProductExpand works with noncommutative field. For example,  it can expand \
multivectors with quaternionic coefficients\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.958093462103792*^9, 3.958093561814543*^9}, {
   3.958093679918531*^9, 3.958093680737525*^9}, {3.960606473613515*^9, 
