Cell["\<\
The other possible setting is \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]CoefficientFunction\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] -> Identity. The option has little effect on  \
multivectors with numerical coefficients in real and complex domain. Only \
relevant for symbolic coefficients. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9606099903277063`*^9, 3.960610007630234*^9}, {
