Cell["\<\
The option in general should never be used if one wants  full expansion. For \
example we can effectively suppress the expansion by setting the iteration \
limit to 0. In general user should never use the option.\
\>", "Text",
 Editable->True,
 TaggingRules->{},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.953987831531402*^9, 3.953987862547078*^9}, {
